      "html": "<button class=\"ds-document\"><div class=\"ds-preview\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-category\">SEO content</span><div class=\"ds-paper\"><strong>Allergen labeling best practices</strong><p>Thoughtful catering for every team.</p><div></div><div></div></div></div><h3>Allergen labeling best practices</h3><p class=\"ds-meta\">L · LunchLink · Sep 14</p></button>",
      "css": ".ds-document{font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;width:210px;padding:0 0 4px;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#303136);text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-document:hover{background:#f7f8fd}.ds-preview{height:125px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:#eff1f6;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding-top:25px;position:relative}.ds-category{position:absolute;top:7px;left:7px;padding:4px 6px;background:#e1edec;color:#485e5b;border-radius:4px;font-size:14px}.ds-paper{width:95px;min-height:140px;background:white;border-radius:3px 3px 0 0;padding:10px 9px;transition:transform .2s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-paper strong{font-size:4.5px}.ds-paper p{font-size:3.4px;line-height:1.6}.ds-paper div{height:2px;background:#edf0f4;margin:3px 0}.ds-document:hover .ds-paper{transform:translateY(-4px)}.ds-document h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;margin:11px 7px 7px;white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-meta{font-size:14px;margin:0 7px;color:#6b7180}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-paper{transition:none}.ds-document:hover .ds-paper{transform:none}}.ds-document:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #7a8be5;outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button,input{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Activity card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "activity-card",
      "description": "White inset card linking a workspace event to its section.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-feed\"><span class=\"ds-avatar\">L</span><span>Social content is ready with <strong>28 generated post sets</strong><small>60 topics planned</small></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-feed{font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;transition:background .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease,color .18s ease;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;background:white;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 14px;width:280px;min-height:87px;text-align:left;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#6c707d;cursor:pointer}.ds-feed:hover{background:#edf0fa}.ds-feed strong{font-weight:400;color:#373a42}.ds-feed small{display:block;margin-top:5px;font-size:14px;color:#6b7180}.ds-avatar{display:grid;place-items:center;width:32px;height:32px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:50%;background:#e6eee8;color:#7b9b83}.ds-feed:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #7a8be5;outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button,input{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}"
